{"id":"13d470f233f3779b","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-essential-undecidability.md","title":"Essential Undecidability Preservation","display":"thm-essential-undecidability — Essential Undecidability Preservation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-essential-undecidability","aliases":["67-thm-essential-undecidability"],"display":"thm-essential-undecidability — Essential Undecidability Preservation","depends_on":["[[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]","[[67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"corollary of Theorem 2","source_printed_pages":17,"source_pdf_pages":28,"source_proof_status":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-essential-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-essential-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-essential-undecidability — Essential Undecidability Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b488bd715fda08a1\" href=\"?note=b488bd715fda08a1\" title=\"67-df-essentially-undecidable\">67-df-essentially-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"438750d9f2566c57\" href=\"?note=438750d9f2566c57\" title=\"67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability\">67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"corollary of Theorem 2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致算术理论且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span>；不要求 T 的当前公理集合可枚举。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUndec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b488bd715fda08a1\" href=\"?note=b488bd715fda08a1\" title=\"67-df-essentially-undecidable\">67-df-essentially-undecidable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的本质不可判定性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"438750d9f2566c57\" href=\"?note=438750d9f2566c57\" title=\"67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability\">67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\\land T\\nvdash\\bot\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\subseteq T\\land T\\nvdash\\bot\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Theorem 1.2 的直接推论。T 的每个一致扩张也是 Q 的一致扩张，因此不可判定。旧条目的 Remark 错称非有效扩张不在 EssUndec 的范围内；本次恢复原书对所有一致扩张的范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"438750d9f2566c57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EssUndec}$ 见 [[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]；$Q$ 的本质不可判定性见 [[67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"438750d9f2566c57","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EssUndec}$ 见 [[67-df-essentially-undecidable]]；$Q$ 的本质不可判定性见 [[67-thm-robinson-essential-undecidability]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq T\\land T\\nvdash\\bot\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T).","display":true}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-essential-undecidability]]"}],"outgoing":["b488bd715fda08a1","438750d9f2566c57"]}